WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.830 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:27.820 --> 01:31.020
Well...is this everything?

01:31.020 --> 01:34.240
Sugar, milk, and also lemon...

01:34.240 --> 01:38.260
Geez, Vanilla sure was brutal with her directions.

01:39.490 --> 01:44.000
Please, Chocolat-chan. I want to make
this lemon pie for dessert tonight.

01:44.700 --> 01:46.040
Could you, please?

01:46.040 --> 01:51.570
Well, s'not like I can complain,
she does all the cooking for us.

01:54.640 --> 01:59.080
Ah, that chocolate-chip ice cream
over there sure is tasty!

02:00.050 --> 02:02.820
Chocolat's Pinch? A Cute Witch Volunteer

02:08.120 --> 02:10.690
It's warm out today, so the ice
cream looks even tastier.

02:11.030 --> 02:12.630
Next in line, what would you like?

02:13.830 --> 02:15.860
Chocolate-chip please! Size--

02:17.800 --> 02:20.930
Eh, I only have enough for--

02:28.180 --> 02:30.740
Aah, the smallest one.

02:37.320 --> 02:39.090
All right! I'll do it!

02:40.160 --> 02:42.520
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

02:50.900 --> 02:51.630
Wand!

03:01.910 --> 03:03.310
All right!

03:03.310 --> 03:06.110
Ice cream! Super-large size, appear!

03:06.480 --> 03:08.120
Sprinkles and topping!

03:12.620 --> 03:15.590
Here. There. Oop!

03:16.020 --> 03:17.560
Being a witch rules!

03:18.530 --> 03:19.090
Here!

03:25.000 --> 03:26.000
Thank you.

03:26.000 --> 03:27.800
Uh...well...

03:29.940 --> 03:31.840
Calm down. Calm down, Chocolat.

03:31.840 --> 03:34.440
She's just a kid! Probably still in kindergarten!

03:34.880 --> 03:37.710
That's right! A trick! Tell her it was a trick!

03:37.710 --> 03:39.320
That wasn't a trick, was it?

03:40.180 --> 03:42.880
Uhm...well...just now, that's...

03:43.220 --> 03:47.420
I saw the whole thing! How the scoops
of ice cream went "Plop! Plop! Plop!"

03:47.820 --> 03:49.870
What was it? Why?

03:50.120 --> 03:52.660
Uh, that was...that was...

03:52.660 --> 03:53.730
Sis, are you a witch?

03:54.900 --> 03:56.400
I knew that had to be it!

03:56.400 --> 03:57.670
Cool! Cool!

03:57.670 --> 03:59.210
This is the first time I've seen one!

03:59.500 --> 04:00.730
No, y'see--

04:01.040 --> 04:02.900
It's not like I'm a witch...

04:04.270 --> 04:06.890
Hey, what else can you do?

04:07.640 --> 04:09.740
Show me magic! Magic!

04:09.740 --> 04:11.110
You're wrong! Wrong!

04:11.480 --> 04:14.210
I'm not some witch or wizard.

04:14.720 --> 04:17.320
Ah! I just remembered somethin'!
I better head home!

04:17.650 --> 04:18.020
See ya!

04:24.130 --> 04:24.690
Uh...

04:26.630 --> 04:28.260
Um...

04:28.800 --> 04:32.270
Saw it. I saw it.

04:33.530 --> 04:36.600
Sis, you're a witch. You're a witch.

04:37.510 --> 04:39.270
You're a witch!!

04:42.110 --> 04:44.110
This way! Let's go this way!

04:46.080 --> 04:47.640
Yummy!

04:47.950 --> 04:50.600
Just as I thought, magic ice cream is super-yummy!

04:52.190 --> 04:52.720
Here!

04:54.120 --> 04:55.650
Have some too, Sis!

04:55.920 --> 04:56.490
Thanks.

04:58.160 --> 05:01.110
Uh, hey. Shouldn't you be going home or somethin'?

05:01.600 --> 05:02.100
It's okay!

05:02.500 --> 05:05.970
Hey, what should I call you, Sis? I'm Sophia!

05:06.630 --> 05:09.100
Sophia, huh? I'm Chocolat.

05:09.100 --> 05:11.170
Chocolat? You mean Chocolat the Witch!

05:14.780 --> 05:19.680
Hey, could you stop saying "witch"
and "magic" in such a loud voice?

05:20.520 --> 05:21.130
Why?

05:21.820 --> 05:24.750
Well...that's...basically...

05:24.750 --> 05:27.820
...no one knows that I'm a witch.

05:27.820 --> 05:29.820
Y'see, it'd make a huge fuss.

05:30.630 --> 05:31.640
I see.

05:32.630 --> 05:35.180
So that's why this has to be a secret
between just you and me.

05:35.460 --> 05:36.030
Okay?

05:36.030 --> 05:36.500
'Kay!

05:37.030 --> 05:37.760
That's my girl!

05:38.670 --> 05:40.730
Well, I better head home.

05:41.040 --> 05:43.200
Sophia, can you make it home by yourself?

05:43.200 --> 05:43.690
Mm-hmm.

05:43.970 --> 05:45.070
Great!

05:45.540 --> 05:47.490
So, see you later!

05:58.290 --> 05:59.020
Huh?

06:02.160 --> 06:05.030
Man, that could've been a major disaster.

06:05.030 --> 06:07.630
Why aren'tcha flying?!

06:08.100 --> 06:09.830
Why, when you're a witch?

06:09.830 --> 06:11.570
That's because--!

06:11.570 --> 06:12.900
Don'tcha have a broom?

06:12.900 --> 06:15.240
A broom to fly in the sky.

06:15.240 --> 06:16.200
Listen here!

06:16.200 --> 06:20.310
Isn't it obvious? No way would I carry
a broom on me all the time.

06:20.310 --> 06:23.380
Really? Then if you have one, you can fly, huh?

06:24.480 --> 06:27.710
How nice. I wanna fly too.

06:28.350 --> 06:30.880
Can you teach me how to use magic, Chocolat?

06:31.650 --> 06:33.390
I wanna use magic, too!

06:33.860 --> 06:36.060
Tell me how to use magic.

06:36.060 --> 06:37.320
Please? Please, Chocolat.

06:40.760 --> 06:43.060
Chocolat-chan, welcome home!

06:44.570 --> 06:45.600
I'm home.

06:46.100 --> 06:48.500
Chocolat-chan. That girl...

06:49.300 --> 06:50.970
Hey, is she a witch, too?

06:53.710 --> 06:57.750
Some stuff happened, and then some more
stuff, and then she followed me home!

06:57.750 --> 06:59.020
No way!

06:59.020 --> 07:01.580
Hey, you're a witch, aren'tcha?

07:02.520 --> 07:04.920
I'm not! I'm not, I'm not, I'm not!

07:04.920 --> 07:06.820
It's not me that's a witch!

07:07.020 --> 07:11.320
"It's not me"? Then if it's not you that's
the witch, Chocolat must be!

07:15.460 --> 07:16.870
Yummy!

07:17.130 --> 07:20.000
Of course, it's Vanilla's lemon pie.

07:20.500 --> 07:25.670
Say, Sophia. After you eat, shouldn't
you be heading home?

07:26.540 --> 07:28.940
After Chocolat tells me how to use magic!

07:30.310 --> 07:34.110
Sophia, non-witches can't use magic.

07:34.980 --> 07:37.350
Even as a witch, it's plenty difficult.

07:38.090 --> 07:38.850
Y'get it?

07:38.850 --> 07:40.020
I don't get it.

07:40.470 --> 07:42.810
Sophia, you ain't a witch, so it's impossible!

07:43.830 --> 07:47.860
It's not impossible! I wanna be
a witch! I wanna use magic!

07:47.860 --> 07:49.260
But you can't!

07:53.900 --> 08:00.070
It's no use, Chocolat-chan. Sophia's too little, she can't understand that. Don't be so harsh.

08:01.140 --> 08:02.410
Don't be mad at Chocolat!

08:02.810 --> 08:04.410
It's not her that's bad!

08:04.850 --> 08:05.180
Yes.

08:05.650 --> 08:09.950
You may not be a witch, but
Chocolat is! She's amazing!

08:09.950 --> 08:11.750
Th...that's true.

08:11.750 --> 08:14.970
Tell me how, Chocolat! I wanna use magic!

08:15.160 --> 08:16.160
Please!

08:17.060 --> 08:18.660
I've got no choice.

08:19.090 --> 08:21.160
If I do, promise not to cry anymore?

08:22.260 --> 08:22.860
Yup!

08:22.860 --> 08:23.860
Chocolat-chan.

08:24.270 --> 08:27.400
Learning how to use magic is painful.
Y'gonna do your best?

08:27.970 --> 08:29.150
Yup! I'll do my best!

08:29.440 --> 08:30.670
Alrighty.

08:32.240 --> 08:32.940
Okay. Here.

08:37.750 --> 08:41.410
This...is this a magical broom? Am I gonna fly on it?

08:41.880 --> 08:44.850
Mmh. But right now it's just a regular broom.

08:45.450 --> 08:52.260
But, if your heart comes together with this broom,
then maybe you can get it to listen to you.

08:53.290 --> 08:54.590
Huh? Really?

08:55.500 --> 08:57.930
But...how do I talk to it?

08:58.430 --> 09:00.170
Well, you can start by cleaning up the yard with it.

09:00.670 --> 09:06.110
If you work hard and get the yard looking
pretty, it'll make the broom happy, too.

09:07.010 --> 09:07.940
Really?

09:08.580 --> 09:09.940
Mmh! I'll do it!

09:10.610 --> 09:13.150
Chocolat-chan, telling her such things...

09:13.550 --> 09:17.850
Don't worry about it. Sooner or later she'll give it up.

09:21.260 --> 09:24.930
That poor dear, doing these chores for Chocolat.

09:24.930 --> 09:29.300
She doesn't give up, does she?
Isn't this enough, Chocolat?

09:29.300 --> 09:31.230
I don't care, I don't care.

09:31.230 --> 09:35.500
She needs to realize how tough
it is to become a witch.

09:36.200 --> 09:37.570
But you know...

09:38.210 --> 09:42.710
Why is this girl looking to Chocolat, when Vanilla is obviously a better-looking witch?

10:01.030 --> 10:01.740
Sophia!

10:03.530 --> 10:06.130
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

10:26.190 --> 10:27.890
You okay, Sophia?

10:29.960 --> 10:33.090
I knew Chocolat could use magic!

10:33.090 --> 10:34.290
Cool! Amazing!

10:34.600 --> 10:36.730
C-cut it out, that's dangerous, Sophia!

10:44.810 --> 10:45.470
Chocolat!

10:47.380 --> 10:49.440
I knew it! Chocolat's amazing!

10:51.880 --> 10:53.150
Oh, my...

11:09.630 --> 11:11.830
Ah! Over there! That's my house.

11:13.230 --> 11:14.030
I'm home!

11:18.170 --> 11:19.170
Takigawa?

11:19.510 --> 11:22.640
Sophia? You shouldn't be staying out so late!

11:24.350 --> 11:26.450
Kato-san. What brings you here?

11:27.480 --> 11:29.520
You know each other?

11:29.520 --> 11:31.550
Yeah. We're in the same class.

11:33.050 --> 11:35.340
Um, was my sister troubling you?

11:35.590 --> 11:37.360
Ah, s'nothing like that...

11:37.890 --> 11:42.300
Sorry, we were hangin' out at my
place, and didn't finish 'til late.

11:42.530 --> 11:46.330
Guess what! Guess what! Chocolat can use magic!

11:48.500 --> 11:51.570
Sorry! She's always saying silly things like this.

11:51.840 --> 11:55.580
Saying she can talk to teddy bears
and other weird stuff like that.

11:56.040 --> 12:00.450
Did she cause you any problems? Thanks for going out of your way to bring her home.

12:00.450 --> 12:01.250
Nah.

12:01.580 --> 12:03.580
Chocolat, can I come over again to play?

12:04.290 --> 12:05.220
Hey, Sophia!

12:05.220 --> 12:06.350
Sure!

12:06.350 --> 12:08.620
Sorry, I'm really sorry!

12:08.620 --> 12:10.040
Well, see you tomorrow.

12:18.570 --> 12:20.200
Will it be okay?

12:21.600 --> 12:25.710
Well, knowing Sophia, she's probably
spilling the beans about the whole thing.

12:26.170 --> 12:28.170
And if Chris believes it,

12:28.970 --> 12:31.040
she'd probably tell the entire class...

12:34.120 --> 12:34.980
That's right!

12:36.020 --> 12:38.720
Ah! Good morning! Kato-san! Ice-san!

12:40.220 --> 12:41.150
Good morning.

12:41.560 --> 12:43.720
I'm really sorry about yesterday.

12:44.130 --> 12:46.730
That girl kept talking about you.

12:47.230 --> 12:51.970
"Ice cream got bigger, a vacuum sucked
up a yard full of leaves," and so on...

12:53.370 --> 12:56.700
That girl has such an imagination.

12:57.140 --> 13:02.170
Just recently she said that a teddy bear that she
lost appears in her dreams and talks to her.

13:02.170 --> 13:03.640
A teddy bear?

13:05.450 --> 13:10.450
She treasured it very much. She's had
it longer than she can remember.

13:12.220 --> 13:15.220
That girl is such a troublemaker, isn't she?

13:15.620 --> 13:18.960
If she's too much to handle, feel free to ignore her.

13:20.760 --> 13:21.430
See ya!

13:23.000 --> 13:26.470
Thank goodness. Chris-chan didn't
believe anything she said.

13:28.940 --> 13:29.700
What's wrong?

13:30.000 --> 13:36.240
Somehow, I really feel sorry for Sophia.
No one ever believes anything she says.

13:46.090 --> 13:47.250
Sophia...

13:47.250 --> 13:49.120
I'm a witch. Cool, huh?

13:49.490 --> 13:51.330
Mmh. Cool.

13:51.330 --> 13:54.100
Uh, am I a pest?

13:54.260 --> 13:58.600
'Cause my sister told me not to come
to your place and pester you.

14:01.670 --> 14:02.610
Not at all!

14:03.000 --> 14:04.540
So, come in, come in!

14:06.070 --> 14:07.570
This is my room.

14:10.780 --> 14:12.710
W-wait a sec, 'kay?

14:15.220 --> 14:17.650
It's not a dream...Keroko...

14:18.990 --> 14:20.460
What a weird toy!

14:24.760 --> 14:25.430
Nighty-night.

14:26.930 --> 14:29.500
Cool! How funny!

14:30.130 --> 14:31.700
S...Sophia...

14:32.570 --> 14:34.200
Is Sophia-chan here?

14:35.640 --> 14:38.470
Say, would you like to eat some cookies together?

14:40.410 --> 14:41.070
Yeah!

14:41.540 --> 14:43.180
I'm saved...

14:46.980 --> 14:48.580
Hey there, you dribbled some.

14:49.150 --> 14:51.380
Your special magic garb'll get dirty.

14:54.090 --> 14:57.090
Chocolat-chan, you're like a real big sister.

14:58.530 --> 14:59.460
You think so?

15:00.330 --> 15:04.360
Hey! You gotta drink too, or you'll
never make a good witch!

15:04.830 --> 15:05.960
Eh?! I'll drink it!

15:06.230 --> 15:09.440
Why d'you wanna be a witch so bad?

15:09.870 --> 15:11.600
W...well...

15:12.070 --> 15:16.010
What's the first thing you'll do with your magic?

15:16.010 --> 15:17.750
Ah! I got it!

15:17.750 --> 15:20.480
You'll make a SUPER HUGE ice cream cone, right?

15:21.450 --> 15:24.080
I wanna talk to Ku-chan.

15:24.920 --> 15:25.790
Ku-chan?

15:26.890 --> 15:30.990
My teddy bear Ku-chan...I treasured
him more than anything.

15:31.390 --> 15:34.030
I lost him in the park.

15:36.430 --> 15:39.570
A teddy bear that she lost appears
in her dreams and talks to her.

15:39.970 --> 15:41.500
She treasured it very much.

15:42.370 --> 15:46.500
I want to tell Ku-chan that I'm sorry!

15:48.510 --> 15:50.580
Chocolat, what are we going to do today?

15:50.580 --> 15:52.550
I wanna hurry up and become a witch!

15:52.910 --> 15:55.890
What am I supposed to do? Clean up your room?

15:56.180 --> 15:57.320
N-no...

15:58.220 --> 15:59.270
Kato-san!

16:03.020 --> 16:05.690
Sorry! I'm really sorry.

16:05.690 --> 16:07.260
No, not at all.

16:07.260 --> 16:08.600
Don't worry about it.

16:08.600 --> 16:13.230
I wanted to show Chocolat the
outfit that you made me.

16:13.600 --> 16:17.100
D-dummy! It's embarrassing to show
her my shoddy stitchwork!

16:17.600 --> 16:20.120
I see. Chris made it for her.

16:20.570 --> 16:23.110
C'mon, lets go home.

16:23.110 --> 16:26.450
Stop bugging these girls about
magic and witches and stuff.

16:26.450 --> 16:27.480
Got it?

16:27.820 --> 16:29.550
Mmh. But...

16:29.550 --> 16:30.540
No "but"s!

16:32.690 --> 16:36.920
Chris is her older sister, the real one.

16:38.760 --> 16:42.830
Hey Vanilla, let's go find Sophia's Ku-chan.

16:49.240 --> 16:52.570
I've been wondering what you two have been up
to, since you haven't been collecting any hearts.

16:52.570 --> 16:54.810
Such disappointing Queen Candidates.

16:54.810 --> 16:57.200
So can you do it or not?!

16:57.510 --> 17:00.680
There is nothing this Rockin' Robin cannot do.

17:02.480 --> 17:04.920
But should I really find it or not?

17:05.090 --> 17:06.850
Of course you should find it!

17:06.850 --> 17:08.000
Hurry up and do it, already!

17:13.490 --> 17:17.760
This is a mirror to see the past.
The day Sophia lost her teddy bear.

17:19.100 --> 17:20.070
There's Sophia.

17:20.070 --> 17:21.300
Is she sleeping?

17:21.300 --> 17:23.600
Then the teddy next to her must be Ku-chan.

17:24.300 --> 17:27.240
Sophia! Time to go home.

17:27.240 --> 17:28.780
Sophia!

17:29.510 --> 17:31.040
Oh dear, she left it.

17:37.020 --> 17:37.940
Hey, wait!

17:41.160 --> 17:44.660
That boy has it! If we can find him--

17:44.660 --> 17:45.890
Wait a moment.

17:58.370 --> 18:00.390
Where are you going, Chocolat?

18:00.390 --> 18:03.270
I'm going to search in the river! Maybe it's still there!

18:04.380 --> 18:07.380
That's impossible. This happened ten days ago.

18:08.420 --> 18:10.320
Even if it's still there...

18:10.650 --> 18:14.280
Then what am I...what am I supposed to do?

18:14.620 --> 18:18.460
I know! I'll use my magic to recreate a duplicate!

18:18.930 --> 18:20.090
That'll do it!

18:21.400 --> 18:25.600
That's a piece of cake with magic, but...

18:25.600 --> 18:30.040
However, even if you can make a perfect replica,

18:30.040 --> 18:34.340
is it really the same as the one that
Sophia treasured so much?

18:35.940 --> 18:39.820
Wouldn't there be a better way
to use magic in this case?

18:46.090 --> 18:47.250
Coming!

18:49.790 --> 18:51.190
Ah! Vanilla!

18:52.560 --> 18:56.690
Say, there is someone I would
like Sophia-chan to meet.

18:56.690 --> 18:58.460
Is Chocolat not here?

18:59.870 --> 19:01.470
Ah, shell be coming later, okay?

19:12.790 --> 19:13.710
Ku-chan!

19:15.050 --> 19:16.850
Ku-chan!

19:17.450 --> 19:19.050
Ku-chan, where did you go?

19:19.050 --> 19:20.550
I've been looking everywhere for you!

19:20.550 --> 19:21.990
Were you here this whole time?

19:22.720 --> 19:24.790
Sophia, I wanted to see you.

19:28.900 --> 19:33.940
Are you surprised? I wanted
to talk to you for a long time.

19:35.100 --> 19:37.570
Ku-chan, since when were you a boy?

19:39.810 --> 19:41.710
My throat is kinda scratchy.

19:42.380 --> 19:50.980
I was in a heavenly kingdom, but I came
back because I wanted to see you again.

19:51.720 --> 19:53.390
A heavenly kingdom?

19:53.390 --> 19:56.670
I wanted to tell you to cheer up and be happy.

19:58.530 --> 20:01.330
I'm sorry, but I can't stay here for long.

20:02.360 --> 20:03.960
You're going away again?

20:04.630 --> 20:08.230
It's okay! I'll always be with you, Sophia.

20:09.340 --> 20:12.270
During the happy times, and the sad times.

20:12.270 --> 20:15.740
And when bad guys appear, I'll whup their butt!

20:18.280 --> 20:20.350
I need to get going.

20:20.550 --> 20:21.610
Ku-chan!

20:23.850 --> 20:28.390
Seeing Sophie smile always made me really happy.

20:28.760 --> 20:31.390
So will you smile for me? Sophia?

20:37.590 --> 20:38.930
I'm so glad.

20:39.370 --> 20:41.260
Goodbye, Sophia.

20:46.910 --> 20:48.310
Ku-chan!

20:50.180 --> 20:51.340
Ku-chan!

20:51.850 --> 20:53.150
Ku-chan!

20:59.890 --> 21:02.320
I'll see her again, right?

21:03.360 --> 21:03.990
Mm-hmm.

21:09.200 --> 21:12.200
Chocolat-chan! Vanilla-chan! You there?

21:12.770 --> 21:14.430
Coming!

21:16.900 --> 21:17.800
Good afternoon!

21:17.800 --> 21:18.640
Chris-chan!

21:19.370 --> 21:20.040
Chocolat!

21:20.710 --> 21:21.640
I'm coming in!

21:21.980 --> 21:22.680
Hey!

21:22.680 --> 21:24.010
It's okay, okay!

21:24.580 --> 21:25.610
Sorry.

21:26.080 --> 21:31.790
Sophia's stopped talking about magic and
witches since she came home yesterday.

21:31.790 --> 21:32.820
What happened?

21:33.820 --> 21:34.950
Who knows?

21:35.590 --> 21:39.260
It probably means that she grew up a teensy bit.

21:44.930 --> 21:46.800
Save me.

21:47.800 --> 21:51.240
This thing talks! How strange!

21:51.570 --> 21:56.000
She said she wanted to go back to Chocolat's place to see all the strange toys she had.

21:56.210 --> 21:58.280
Chocolat! Can I have it?

21:58.960 --> 22:00.780
You can't, Sophia!

22:00.780 --> 22:01.480
Sure!

22:03.020 --> 22:04.520
But you can't!

22:05.090 --> 22:07.890
If that's what you want, help yourself!

22:08.820 --> 22:10.880
Wow! Yay!

22:10.880 --> 22:13.630
You're cruel, Chocolat!

22:23.120 --> 22:29.450
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.540 --> 22:30.950
"Love"

22:31.860 --> 22:35.370
A magic spell.

22:37.500 --> 22:44.780
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.210 --> 22:54.280
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:55.960 --> 23:00.230
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.830 --> 23:03.890
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.200 --> 23:11.270
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.640 --> 23:16.080
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.080 --> 23:26.190
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.250 --> 23:35.160
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:46.100 --> 23:49.600
I bought some Dreamy Magical Teacups from the Magical Shopping Catalogue.

23:49.600 --> 23:52.610
With these I can look inside everyone else's dreams.

23:52.990 --> 23:58.130
Vanilla, Duke, Mimura, and Akira... What kinda dreams do they have?

23:58.130 --> 24:01.920
That's right! I can find out what kinda dreams Pierre has, too!

24:02.610 --> 24:05.930
Maybe I can get a hind to collecting his heart!

24:06.620 --> 24:11.090
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:
The Dreamy Magical Teacups

24:11.620 --> 24:13.650
If you don't watch it, I'll whup your butt!

24:13.650 --> 24:14.300
Thanks!
